                <pb facs="0175" n="168" xml:id="pg168"/>

                <head>No. 92.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Baker.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-16"><hi rendition="#italic">August 16,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your dispatch, 344, received. Pull advices from naval commanders show that very
                    few American citizens were concerned in the recent movement at Bluefields, and
                    none of good repute.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
